  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3bae0299f81ef4d438a038f59b0dced7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  conversation1Text:
  - "Hello there Ma'am. My name is Paul and I\u2019ve just started my own handyman
    business. Do you have anything I can help with? "
  - 'Hi Paul. Yes I do have a few things but im a bit wary to hire someone with so
    little experience. Have you been in business long? '
  - 'Today is my first day. '
  - "Christ! I tell you what, I'll let you paint my fence but I'm only gonna pay
    you \xA3100. If you do a good job and complete it in a fair amount of time I'll
    give you a bonus."
  - I completely understand ma'am, I'll need some money up front for tools and supplies
  - 'You don''t have any tools? '
  - "No ma\u2019am."
  - " Ridiculous. Well I guess I'm gonna need to pay you up front then. You\u2019re
    not gonna get very far with nothing to paint with. "
  - 'What colour paint do you want your fence in? '
  - Anything bright. But please don't get paint anywhere else other than the fence.
    I won't be happy and I will be asking for a partial refund.
  - "kay Ma\u2019m. Thank you. "
  - "Just knock on the door when you\u2019re done. Do you want a cuppa? "
  - "Oh yes please Ma\u2019am. Milk, 2 sugars please."
  - 
